    "faq": {
      "type": "popdarts-cm-faq",
      "settings": {},
      "blocks": {
        "sale": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's on sale — and do I need a code?",
            "answer": "<p>Eligible products on this page show their sale price and saving, and that's the price you pay — no code needed. It isn't a sitewide sale: only products showing a saving here are included. Taxes and shipping are calculated at checkout.</p>",
            "anchor": "",
            "show_in": "not_after"
          }
        },
        "ended": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is Cyber Monday pricing still on?",
            "answer": "<p>Cyber Monday has ended, so prices are back to regular. <a href=\"/collections/all\">Shop every Popdarts game</a>.</p>",
            "anchor": "",
            "show_in": "after"
          }
        },
        "excluded": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is anything excluded?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Elite products and gift cards are never discounted, and slightly used or returned items aren't part of this sale.</p>",
            "anchor": "",
            "show_in": "all"
          }
        },
        "shipping": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will my order ship?",
            "answer": "<p>Orders are processed within 1–2 business days (excluding weekends and holidays), and you'll get a tracking email when your order ships. Shipping options and rates depend on your location and are shown at checkout. International shipping is available for select products; duties are paid by the customer. See our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Policy</a>.</p>",
            "anchor": "",
            "show_in": "all"
          }
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I return a Cyber Monday purchase?",
            "answer": "<p>Sale items are final sale — our refund policy doesn't accept returns on sale items or gift cards. If something arrives damaged, defective or wrong, email <a href=\"mailto:Support@popdartsgame.com\">Support@popdartsgame.com</a> right away so we can make it right. Full-price items can be returned within 30 days if unused and in the original packaging. See our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Refund Policy</a>.</p>",
            "anchor": "",
            "show_in": "all"
          }
        },
        "play": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where can we play?",
            "answer": "<p>Anywhere with a smooth surface — glass, windows, countertops, even the fridge — indoors or out. Popdarts are suction cups, so they won't stick to textured or porous surfaces like wood.</p>",
            "anchor": "",
            "show_in": "all"
          }
        },
        "score": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does scoring work?",
            "answer": "<p>The closest Popdart to the Target Marker scores 3 points, and every other Popdart that sticks scores 1. Land on top of the PRO Target Marker™ (in the Pro Pack) for 10. It's cancellation scoring, like cornhole — first to 21 wins, and going over is allowed. <a href=\"/pages/play\">Full rules</a></p>",
            "anchor": "",
            "show_in": "all"
          }
        },
        "rookiepro": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Rookie or Pro?",
            "answer": "<p>Rookie for beginners and younger players — the Rookie Pack is made for ages 5 to 95. Pro for competitors — the Pro Pack adds the PRO Target Marker™, where landing on top scores 10. Both packs come with 6 Popdarts (3 per player), a Target Marker, a carrying bag with the rules and a built-in ruler, and stickers.</p>",
            "anchor": "cm-rookie-pro",
            "show_in": "all"
          }
        }
      },
